610 0 obj
<<
/Title (It appears the bustling commercial district outside of SD North hides a sinister secret- a clandestine cabal caught in a convoluted ring of smuggling, producing, and laundering valuable textiles. The report suggests that the Banner Syndicate has long been deeply entrenched in the economic ongoings of Banhattan, allegedly using several storefronts to move their own product. We interviewed Mr. Luzon, the owner of a local hardware store, who denied any knowledge of the supposed syndicate.)
/Dest [12 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 605 0 R
/Prev 608 0 R
/Next 612 0 R
>>
endobj
